---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: "foodpages.items"
  size: 1
  alias: food
permalink: "/food/{{ food.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ food.pageName }} Nutrition in Pregnancy"
  description: "{{ food.metaDescription }}"
  schemaType: WebPage
  bodyClass: page-food-detail
pageStyles:
  - /style/weekly-diet.css
  - /style/food.css?v=20260812
---

<article class="section food-static-page">
  <nav class="food-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/food/">Foods</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ food.pageName }}</span>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero slim food-detail-hero{% if food.image and food.image.src %} has-image{% endif %}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Pregnancy food guide</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title food-detail-title"><span class="food-detail-name">{{ food.pageName }}</span> <span class="food-detail-context">Nutrition in pregnancy</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">See how a 100 gram portion compares with pregnancy nutrient reference amounts. Use this as a comparison tool, not personalized medical advice.</p>
      <p class="food-group-label">Food group: {{ food.group }}</p>
    </div>
    {% if food.image and food.image.src %}
      <figure class="food-detail-image">
        <img src="{{ food.image.src }}" alt="{{ food.image.alt or ('100 grams of ' ~ food.pageName) }}"{% if food.image.width %} width="{{ food.image.width }}"{% endif %}{% if food.image.height %} height="{{ food.image.height }}"{% endif %} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
        <figcaption>Illustrative 100 gram portion</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {% endif %}
  </header>

  {% if not food.topNutrients.length %}
    <p class="content-summary">This reference entry lists no nonzero amounts for PregNut's tracked nutrients. Its chart cannot assess the food's overall nutritional value or pregnancy safety.</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if food.topNutrients.length %}
    <section class="food-glance" aria-labelledby="food-glance-title">
      <div class="food-glance-heading">
        <p class="content-eyebrow">At a glance</p>
        <h2 id="food-glance-title">Strongest nutrient contributions</h2>
        <p>Highest shares of nutrient reference amounts in this 100 gram portion.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="food-glance-list">
        {% for row in food.topNutrients %}
          <li>
            <span class="food-glance-rank" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span class="food-glance-copy"><strong>{{ row.name }}</strong><span>{{ row.value | formatNumber }} {{ row.unit }}</span></span>
            <span class="food-glance-value">{{ row.displayPercent }}%</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if food.warning %}
    <aside class="content-card food-safety-note{% if food.warning | lower == 'avoid' %} is-avoid{% endif %}" aria-label="Food safety note">
      <div class="food-safety-heading">
        <p class="content-eyebrow">Food safety</p>
        <h2 class="content-title">Pregnancy guidance</h2>
        <span class="food-safety-badge">{{ food.warning }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="content-summary">{{ food.warningText }}</p>
      {% if food.group == "Finfish and Shellfish Products" %}
        <p class="content-summary">Check the <a href="https://www.fda.gov/food/consumers/advice-about-eating-fish">current FDA/EPA fish chart</a> for mercury guidance and <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/pregnant-women.html">CDC's pregnancy food-safety guidance</a> for preparation.</p>
      {% else %}
        <p class="content-summary">Source: <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/pregnant-women.html">CDC's pregnancy food-safety guidance</a>.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isCheese %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/soft-cheese-pregnancy/">guide to cheese, pasteurization, and pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose a cheese.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isMilkOrYogurt %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/raw-milk-pregnancy/">guide to milk and yogurt pasteurization during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose a dairy product.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isEgg %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/eggs-during-pregnancy/">guide to egg doneness and pasteurization during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose an egg dish.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isJuice %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/juice-pasteurization-pregnancy/">guide to juice pasteurization and fresh-squeezed drinks during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose a drink.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isSeedSprout %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/sprouts-during-pregnancy/">guide to raw and cooked sprouts during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose sprouts.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.group == "Sausages and Luncheon Meats" %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/deli-meat-pregnancy/">guide to deli meat, cold cuts, and reheating during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose a ready-to-eat meat.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
  {% else %}
    <aside class="content-card food-safety-note" aria-label="Food safety note">
      <div class="food-safety-heading">
        <p class="content-eyebrow">Food safety</p>
        <h2 class="content-title">Check preparation guidance</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="content-summary">This entry has no food-specific safety note. Nutrient data alone cannot establish whether a food or its preparation is safe during pregnancy. See <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/food-safety/foods/pregnant-women.html">CDC's safer food choices for pregnancy</a> for general guidance.</p>
      {% if food.isProteinPowder %}
        <p class="content-summary">For the serving size, added ingredients, and prenatal overlap, read our <a href="/blog/protein-powder-pregnancy/">guide to protein powder labels during pregnancy</a>.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isMilkOrYogurt %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/raw-milk-pregnancy/">guide to milk and yogurt pasteurization during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose a dairy product.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.isSeedSprout %}
        <p class="content-summary">Read our <a href="/blog/sprouts-during-pregnancy/">guide to raw and cooked sprouts during pregnancy</a> before using this nutrient chart to choose sprouts.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if food.group == "Finfish and Shellfish Products" %}
        <p class="content-summary">Also check the <a href="https://www.fda.gov/food/consumers/advice-about-eating-fish">current FDA/EPA fish chart</a> for mercury guidance.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="content-card food-chart-card" aria-labelledby="food-chart-title">
    <div class="content-head">
      <p class="content-eyebrow">Per 100 grams</p>
      <h2 class="content-title" id="food-chart-title">Nutrient reference coverage</h2>
      <p class="content-summary">Nutrients are ranked from highest to lowest contribution using adult pregnancy reference amounts. Bars stop visually at 100%, while the label shows the full value. DHA and protein use illustrative comparison benchmarks; <a href="/about/#nutrient-references">see how the references are used</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="food-list" aria-label="Food nutrient bars">
      <div class="food-item">
        <div class="food-bars">
          {% for row in food.chartRows %}
            <div class="bar-row" style="--nutrient-color: {{ row.color }}; --bar-percent: {{ row.barPercent }}%;">
              <div class="bar-label">{{ row.name }}</div>
              <div class="bar-track" role="img" aria-label="{{ row.name }}: {% if row.displayPercent == null %}not available{% else %}{{ row.displayPercent }}% of the nutrient reference amount{% endif %}">
                <span class="bar-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="bar-value {% if row.isOver100 %}is-inside{% else %}is-outside{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true">{% if row.displayPercent == null %}—{% else %}{{ row.displayPercent }}%{% endif %}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="food-table-title">
    <div class="content-head">
      <h2 class="content-title" id="food-table-title">Nutrients per 100 grams</h2>
      <p class="content-summary">Reference amounts are shown for context and are not a recommendation to meet them from one food.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="table-shell">
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Nutrient</th><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">Reference amount</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in food.nutrientRows %}
            <tr><th scope="row">{{ row.name }}</th><td>{{ row.value | formatNumber }} {{ row.unit }}</td><td>{{ row.target }}</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if food.guideLinks.length %}
    <section class="content-card food-related" aria-labelledby="food-guides-title">
      <div class="content-head">
        <h2 class="content-title" id="food-guides-title">Understand these nutrients</h2>
        <p class="content-summary">Read how to use food comparisons alongside everyday portions and prenatal labels.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="guide-link-list related-food-list">
        {% for guide in food.guideLinks %}
          <li><a href="{{ guide.url }}">{{ guide.title }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="content-card food-related" aria-labelledby="related-foods-title">
    <div class="content-head">
      <h2 class="content-title" id="related-foods-title">More from {{ food.group }}</h2>
      <p class="content-summary"><a href="/food/">Search or browse all foods</a>, or compare nutrient-dense choices in <a href="/app/">Top Foods</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {% if food.relatedFoods.length %}
      <ul class="guide-link-list related-food-list">
        {% for related in food.relatedFoods %}
          <li><a href="{{ related.url }}">{{ related.name }} nutrition in pregnancy</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</article>
